[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145099651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109204#issuecomment-3145099651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109204","id":3145099651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67dmmD","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T16:17:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T16:17:39Z","body":"Enum is:\n```\nenum DiagonalMode {\n\t\tDIAGONAL_MODE_ALWAYS,\n\t\tDIAGONAL_MODE_NEVER,\n\t\tDIAGONAL_MODE_AT_LEAST_ONE_WALKABLE,\n\t\tDIAGONAL_MODE_ONLY_IF_NO_OBSTACLES,\n\t\tDIAGONAL_MODE_MAX,\n\t};\n```\n\nBut later in the bindings it is\n\n```\n`ADD_PROPERTY(PropertyInfo(Variant::INT, \"diagonal_mode\", PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM, \"Never,Always,At Least One Walkable,Only If No Obstacles\"), \"set_diagonal_mode\", \"get_diagonal_mode\");`\n```\n\n\nSo here the first part of the hint string is flipped, it should be \"Always,Never,At Least One Walkable,Only If No Obstacles\" to match the order of the enum.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godo